    "text": "## sub_54D080_0054d080 — Triangle mesh bounding sphere computation\n\n**Summary:** For each triangle in a mesh, computes centroid, bounding sphere radius (max vertex distance from centroid), and dominant normal axis. Handles both 48-byte and 64-byte vertex strides based on MMX flag.\n\n**Frame-path:** ON_FRAME_PATH  \n**Call frequency:** per-frame tick\n\n**Called by:** GlobalVectorOffsetUpdate (0040e1f0), PhysicsAudioVectorUpdate (004e2ad0), VertexBufferTransform (0054c6c0)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x14 | R | — | Flags field (bit 0x800000 tests MMX stride) |\n| this | 0x120 | R | — | Triangle count (number of elements to process) |\n| this | 0x124 | R | — | Pointer to triangle index/attribute array (stride 36 bytes) |\n| this | 0x12C | R | — | Pointer to vertex position data array |\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0059e440 | flt_59E440 | R | ZeroThreshold (~0.0f, physics clamp) [DERIVED] |\n| 0059e98c | flt_59E98C | R | AccelerationTuningFactor [DERIVED] (also: ` — acceleration tuning) |\n| 00800000 | unk_800000 | R | MMXFlag [DERIVED] |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n\n**Guard conditions (deterministic — field vs literal):**\n\n| Base | Offset | Test | Value | Field / meaning |\n|------|--------|------|-------|-----------------|\n| this | 0x120 | > | 0 | Triangle count — must be positive to process |\n\n**Guard interpretation:** If `this[0x120]` (triangle count) is ≤ 0 → return 0 immediately, no triangles processed. Passes when count > 0.\n"
